 r←Test_HTTP_007(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;request;res;names
⍝ Send the very same request twice: the headers `SendAndReceive` adds must not pile up.
⍝ They used to be appended with every call, so a re-used request carried them again and again.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 request←R.NewRequest 0
 request.Headers,←⊂'Accept' 'application/json'
 request.RequestTarget←'/v1/packages/exist/aplteam-APLProcess-0.2.0'

 res←TC.SendAndReceive ∆LocalHostAndPort request
 →T.PassesIf 200=res.StatusCode
 res←TC.SendAndReceive ∆LocalHostAndPort request
 →T.PassesIf 200=res.StatusCode

 names←⎕C⊃¨request.Headers
 →T.PassesIf(⊂'x-tatin')∊names
 →T.PassesIf names≡∪names

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
